WEBVTT

00:01:38.030 --> 00:01:41.910
This is my first time to a spa resort.

00:01:47.590 --> 00:01:51.100
There are many different types
of baths here, aren't there?

00:01:51.100 --> 00:01:54.140
Yeah, and they all seem like hot springs!

00:01:54.140 --> 00:01:57.910
It looks like there are other kinds
of attractions besides the baths.

00:01:57.910 --> 00:02:01.050
Wow, I'm looking forward to it!

00:02:01.050 --> 00:02:02.310
Now, let's go, let's go!

00:02:17.260 --> 00:02:20.370
Wow, amazing!

00:02:21.570 --> 00:02:23.700
Ah, they have a game arcade!

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:25.540
And a souvenir shop!

00:02:25.540 --> 00:02:27.290
And a movie theater!

00:02:27.290 --> 00:02:28.920
Even a playhouse?

00:02:28.920 --> 00:02:33.180
Heated pool, restaurant district, bowling alley...

00:02:33.180 --> 00:02:35.640
It looks like they even have a bank.

00:02:35.640 --> 00:02:38.050
But first, the baths, the baths!

00:02:38.050 --> 00:02:39.580
So, let's get in.

00:02:39.580 --> 00:02:41.010
Yeah!

00:02:47.770 --> 00:02:48.620
Ah!

00:02:50.810 --> 00:02:51.770
Ah!

00:02:54.530 --> 00:02:55.660
Papa!

00:03:09.980 --> 00:03:12.910
Wide, open baths feel wonderful.

00:03:12.910 --> 00:03:14.470
Yahoo!

00:03:18.020 --> 00:03:19.800
This is heaven.

00:03:21.620 --> 00:03:25.850
Large baths really are nice, aren't they?

00:03:25.850 --> 00:03:26.760
Wow!

00:03:26.760 --> 00:03:29.730
There are so many different kinds of baths!

00:03:29.730 --> 00:03:33.520
All right! Since we came all
this way, let's go in them all!

00:03:33.520 --> 00:03:34.760
Yeah!

00:03:37.870 --> 00:03:39.530
Waterfall bath!

00:03:40.280 --> 00:03:41.440
Jacuzzi!

00:03:43.140 --> 00:03:44.870
It tickles!

00:03:44.990 --> 00:03:46.870
This is the Goemon bath.

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:50.500
Somehow, it feels like
we're being boiled in a pot...

00:03:50.580 --> 00:03:52.250
Electric bath!

00:03:53.290 --> 00:03:55.290
It's making me numb.

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:57.830
A streaming bath...

00:03:57.830 --> 00:04:00.700
Hey, isn't this just a pool?

00:04:00.700 --> 00:04:01.990
You know, a pool...

00:04:02.860 --> 00:04:05.160
And a jungle bath!

00:04:12.270 --> 00:04:14.540
They're so noisy.

00:04:14.540 --> 00:04:17.190
I want to enjoy my bath in peace and quiet.

00:04:17.710 --> 00:04:21.740
Then shall we go to the sauna?

00:04:49.140 --> 00:04:53.180
When I take a deep breath, my chest gets hotter.

00:04:53.180 --> 00:04:57.190
If you sweat a lot, your skin
will become nice and smooth.

00:04:58.250 --> 00:05:02.450
I'll do my best to get nice and smooth, then get Kaoru-sama to look at me.

00:05:03.120 --> 00:05:07.070
I've been eating too much lately,
so I need to lose a little weight.

00:05:46.150 --> 00:05:48.160
I can't take any more!

00:05:53.910 --> 00:05:56.750
We sweated a lot, didn't we?

00:05:56.750 --> 00:05:59.790
I thought I was going to dry up into a mummy.

00:06:07.520 --> 00:06:08.620
The others?

00:06:08.620 --> 00:06:10.890
I think they'll be coming out in a bit.

00:06:15.980 --> 00:06:17.420
Kaoru-sama.

00:06:17.420 --> 00:06:18.300
Ah?!

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:21.300
Here, please look.

00:06:21.300 --> 00:06:23.820
My skin has become this smooth.

00:06:23.820 --> 00:06:25.070
Heh!

00:06:26.340 --> 00:06:27.490
It's true.

00:06:28.580 --> 00:06:30.280
It's so smooth.

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:33.530
Oh, Kaoru-sama, that tickles.

00:06:33.990 --> 00:06:35.980
It's okay, isn't it, Aoi-chan?

00:06:35.980 --> 00:06:38.370
Let me feel the smoothness a little more.

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:40.370
Eh, but...

00:06:40.370 --> 00:06:42.960
Ah! Please don't, after all.

00:06:47.090 --> 00:06:48.930
Kaoru! Ooya-san{Miss Landlord}!

00:06:48.930 --> 00:06:50.010
Sorry for the wait!

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:51.970
Let's eat, let's eat!

00:07:06.180 --> 00:07:09.650
Beer tastes great right after a bath, doesn't it?

00:07:09.650 --> 00:07:10.550
Huh?

00:07:11.550 --> 00:07:12.910
Where's Miyabi-san?

00:07:13.250 --> 00:07:14.790
If you're looking for Miyabi Onee-chan,

00:07:14.790 --> 00:07:17.660
she went over to the massage
chairs and hasn't come back.

00:07:28.400 --> 00:07:31.550
She might be the one enjoying this to the fullest.

00:07:31.550 --> 00:07:35.510
Hey, hey, let's try going to some
places besides the baths, too!

00:07:35.510 --> 00:07:36.680
All right!

00:07:36.680 --> 00:07:39.610
Then after this, everyone's off on their own!

00:07:39.610 --> 00:07:41.190
Yeah!

00:07:51.030 --> 00:07:55.120
Everyone, we truly thank you all for coming here.

00:07:55.560 --> 00:07:59.830
We are now having a stamp rally
to help you best enjoy our spa.

00:08:00.270 --> 00:08:05.040
We'll give a wonderful prize to
those who collect all the stamps.

00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:07.710
So please try it out!

00:08:08.310 --> 00:08:09.810
A wonderful prize, she said!

00:08:09.810 --> 00:08:10.920
Let's try that!

00:08:16.010 --> 00:08:21.980
Oh, beer tastes great right after
a bath, doesn't it, Miyabi-san?

00:08:23.360 --> 00:08:23.940
That's it...

00:08:43.240 --> 00:08:44.460
All right!

00:08:45.250 --> 00:08:47.130
I won't lose this time!

00:08:54.620 --> 00:08:56.470
I did it!

00:09:02.400 --> 00:09:03.980
Ooya-san{Miss Landlord}!

00:09:03.980 --> 00:09:05.570
Tina-san?

00:09:05.570 --> 00:09:09.480
Hey, since we've come all this way, how about taking one more bath?

00:09:09.480 --> 00:09:10.200
Eh!

00:09:10.200 --> 00:09:11.570
But I...

00:09:13.940 --> 00:09:15.820
Hey, hey, it is fine?

00:09:15.820 --> 00:09:16.770
Let's go, let's go!

00:09:16.770 --> 00:09:19.080
Ah! Um, wait, Tina-san!

00:09:19.080 --> 00:09:20.920
It's okay. It's okay.

00:09:20.920 --> 00:09:22.220
Aoi-chan.

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:28.610
Maybe I'll take one more bath.

00:09:29.860 --> 00:09:32.760
I wasn't able to take my time earlier, after all.

00:09:38.800 --> 00:09:41.270
A reservable bath, huh?

00:09:41.270 --> 00:09:43.240
All right, I'll try this one.

00:09:45.540 --> 00:09:47.060
I just need to spin this, right...

00:09:56.530 --> 00:09:57.820
What's this?

00:09:58.450 --> 00:09:59.340
Huh?!

00:10:01.280 --> 00:10:02.160
Here!

00:10:01.280 --> 00:10:02.690
Funny!

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:06.500
What are you doing?

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:08.130
We're going.

00:10:08.130 --> 00:10:09.500
Okay!

00:10:37.460 --> 00:10:39.700
Let's start the stamp rally!

00:10:40.090 --> 00:10:42.320
First up is hot spring ping-pong!

00:10:48.290 --> 00:10:49.230
Got it!

00:10:52.070 --> 00:10:53.920
Hot spring manjyu!

00:10:55.780 --> 00:10:57.840
Delicious!

00:10:59.810 --> 00:11:01.680
Hot spring calligraphy.

00:11:03.420 --> 00:11:06.600
But does this have anything to do with hot springs?

00:11:07.220 --> 00:11:10.270
Next is eating hot spring eggs as fast as you can!

00:11:19.070 --> 00:11:22.260
Being in a reservable bath really is relaxing.

00:11:26.340 --> 00:11:28.280
Isn't strange?!

00:11:28.280 --> 00:11:30.920
I heard that it's here, though.

00:11:30.920 --> 00:11:32.510
Oh, there it is.

00:11:32.510 --> 00:11:34.000
There it is!

00:11:35.790 --> 00:11:37.690
We've finally found it.

00:11:37.690 --> 00:11:40.090
We looked for it for a while.

00:11:40.090 --> 00:11:43.290
A reservable open air bath?

00:11:43.290 --> 00:11:44.660
Well, let's go in.

00:11:44.660 --> 00:11:45.760
O-Okay.

00:11:52.820 --> 00:11:54.900
Eh, someone came in.

00:11:54.900 --> 00:11:56.820
Isn't this supposed to be a reserved bath?

00:11:58.210 --> 00:12:00.410
You're coming along quite nicely.

00:12:00.410 --> 00:12:02.320
Geez, Tina-san.

00:12:02.320 --> 00:12:04.280
T-That voice...

00:12:05.410 --> 00:12:07.660
Whoa! Ooya-san{Miss Landlord} look!

00:12:09.450 --> 00:12:12.010
Wow, it's so beautiful!

00:12:14.210 --> 00:12:17.390
As I thought it is Aoi-chan and Tina.

00:12:15.580 --> 00:12:17.390
Yahoo!

00:12:18.170 --> 00:12:20.460
W-W-What should I do?

00:12:20.460 --> 00:12:22.260
There's only one exit.

00:12:28.440 --> 00:12:30.270
This feels great!

00:12:30.270 --> 00:12:32.640
Open air baths really are the best!

00:12:32.640 --> 00:12:37.860
Being able to reserve this large
bath somehow feels so luxurious.

00:12:38.510 --> 00:12:41.000
There's no way to get out like this.

00:12:46.550 --> 00:12:48.660
I'm sorry, Ooya-san{Miss Landlord}.

00:12:50.250 --> 00:12:51.620
Eh?!

00:12:53.030 --> 00:12:55.580
Actually, I...

00:12:55.900 --> 00:12:58.970
There's something I want to say to you, Ooya-san{Miss Landlord}.

00:12:58.970 --> 00:13:00.550
So, I took you here.

00:13:00.550 --> 00:13:02.590
W-What is it?

00:13:05.870 --> 00:13:10.060
Thank you so much for taking care of me.

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:13.730
W-What are you saying so suddenly?

00:13:13.730 --> 00:13:17.950
Well, I've been thinking
about a lot of things recently.

00:13:17.950 --> 00:13:20.980
So, I was thinking I should properly thank you.

00:13:21.390 --> 00:13:24.190
But I'll still be causing you problems.

00:13:28.730 --> 00:13:33.560
I really love my life right now.

00:13:34.710 --> 00:13:38.840
See, do you remember the first day I stayed?

00:13:41.010 --> 00:13:47.100
You and {Miss Manager}Kanrinin-san sure were surprised to see someone like me show up.

00:13:48.220 --> 00:13:52.480
And then Tae-chin showed up, asking to live there.

00:13:53.890 --> 00:13:58.190
We started keeping Uzume as
a pet because of my selfishness.

00:14:01.530 --> 00:14:03.960
And then, Chika-rin came, too.

00:14:07.860 --> 00:14:10.740
Laughing so happily with everyone every day,

00:14:11.740 --> 00:14:16.680
I never thought I would have
such good memories in Japan.

00:14:24.950 --> 00:14:26.080
You know, I...

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:30.690
lived in Japan for ten years since I was five.

00:14:30.690 --> 00:14:34.520
But at first, I wasn't really able to make friends.

00:14:34.520 --> 00:14:36.500
Eh! But...

00:14:36.500 --> 00:14:40.470
Well, I was able to make quite a few in junior high.

00:14:40.470 --> 00:14:43.730
Look, I'm an American, right?

00:14:44.910 --> 00:14:46.940
My hair is blonde.

00:14:48.210 --> 00:14:49.460
And my eyes are blue, too.

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:54.890
No one would look at me like I was normal...

00:14:55.850 --> 00:14:59.870
That's why I went to America for high school.

00:14:59.870 --> 00:15:02.320
What do you think happened then?

00:15:02.320 --> 00:15:02.960
Eh?!

00:15:03.320 --> 00:15:06.260
This time, since I was kind of Japanese inside,

00:15:06.260 --> 00:15:08.170
I wasn't able to make any friends at all.

00:15:10.300 --> 00:15:11.140
Funny, isn't it?

00:15:18.340 --> 00:15:19.230
But...

00:15:19.610 --> 00:15:20.980
But...

00:15:20.980 --> 00:15:24.270
Right now, everyone accepts me.

00:15:25.580 --> 00:15:27.520
I'm not Japanese.

00:15:27.520 --> 00:15:29.620
Nor am I American.

00:15:29.620 --> 00:15:31.850
Yet you accept me as I am.

00:15:32.820 --> 00:15:37.520
To me, you're all like my real family.

00:15:38.460 --> 00:15:40.760
So, Ooya-san{Miss Landlord}...

00:15:40.760 --> 00:15:45.700
Thank you so much for letting
someone like me live with you.

00:15:45.700 --> 00:15:47.100
N-No way.

00:15:47.100 --> 00:15:49.040
Please stop, Tina-san.

00:15:49.040 --> 00:15:51.800
I haven't done anything special, after all.

00:15:57.510 --> 00:15:59.810
That's one of the things I love about you!

00:16:00.380 --> 00:16:03.810
Please don't squeeze my breasts!

00:16:04.770 --> 00:16:08.360
Please stop! Honestly, Tina-san.

00:16:09.220 --> 00:16:14.700
Really, I love you because you're
naturally nice, Ooya-san{Miss Landlord}!

00:16:15.300 --> 00:16:18.700
She's a bit strict, but I love {Miss Manager}Kanrinin-san, too.

00:16:19.230 --> 00:16:22.100
She's a bit clumsy, but that's the Tae-chin I love.

00:16:23.100 --> 00:16:25.830
I love Chika-rin, who's always full of energy!

00:16:26.710 --> 00:16:28.880
I cannot say that I love Mayucchi, though,

00:16:28.880 --> 00:16:31.340
but things would be lonely without her.

00:16:31.840 --> 00:16:33.470
Kaoru is...

00:16:34.820 --> 00:16:35.980
Kaoru is...

00:16:40.250 --> 00:16:42.360
Ooya-san{Miss Landlord}, do you love Kaoru?

00:16:42.360 --> 00:16:42.940
Eh!

00:16:42.940 --> 00:16:44.390
Wha-

00:16:44.390 --> 00:16:46.560
No, I... that is...

00:16:46.560 --> 00:16:48.960
You see... how can I say...

00:16:48.960 --> 00:16:50.110
Um...

00:16:53.770 --> 00:16:56.640
When I first met Kaoru...

00:17:00.070 --> 00:17:01.620
Morning!

00:17:03.640 --> 00:17:04.540
Morning.

00:17:05.010 --> 00:17:07.110
He was a really curt guy.

00:17:08.120 --> 00:17:11.090
Even when you talked to him,
all his answers were halfhearted.

00:17:11.090 --> 00:17:14.260
Eh! Kaoru-sama was?

00:17:14.660 --> 00:17:22.220
But when I saw Kaoru like that he seemed
like me, when I wasn't able to make friends.

00:17:27.000 --> 00:17:32.570
It was after that that somehow
I just couldn't leave him alone.

00:17:35.910 --> 00:17:37.210
Tina!

00:17:37.210 --> 00:17:38.870
So that's how it was.

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:44.850
Kaoru is a nice guy, right?

00:17:44.850 --> 00:17:47.820
He worries more about others than himself.

00:17:47.820 --> 00:17:51.550
Despite that, he doesn't
show his true feelings much.

00:17:51.550 --> 00:17:53.160
That's not true.

00:17:53.160 --> 00:17:54.720
Ah, I know.

00:17:56.360 --> 00:18:00.030
Did you just hear a strange sound?

00:18:00.030 --> 00:18:02.160
I didn't really hear anything, though.

00:18:03.170 --> 00:18:04.350
I see.

00:18:06.210 --> 00:18:10.060
I've been wondering that...

00:18:10.060 --> 00:18:11.320
Kaoru...

00:18:12.780 --> 00:18:16.310
Kaoru needs someone who supports him.

00:18:17.380 --> 00:18:18.310
Eh!

00:18:23.790 --> 00:18:25.290
Just kidding!

00:18:25.290 --> 00:18:27.890
We were talking so seriously, weren't we?

00:18:28.930 --> 00:18:30.330
Let's get out.

00:18:30.330 --> 00:18:32.200
The heat will go to our heads.

00:18:32.200 --> 00:18:33.250
Right.

00:18:43.710 --> 00:18:45.970
Congratulations on making it to the goal!

00:18:45.970 --> 00:18:48.480
Good work, everyone.

00:18:48.480 --> 00:18:50.310
Did you have a good time?

00:18:50.310 --> 00:18:50.980
Yes!

00:18:50.980 --> 00:18:53.050
Then, here's your prize!

00:18:53.050 --> 00:18:56.920
It's our resort's mascot,
<i>Just Out of The Bath, Sabao-kun.</i>

00:18:56.920 --> 00:18:58.760
Yay! We did it!

00:19:06.200 --> 00:19:11.960
Beer tastes great right after
a bath, doesn't it, Tina-senpai?

00:19:12.910 --> 00:19:16.090
Tae-chin, I'm over here.

00:19:17.440 --> 00:19:19.050
Huh? Where is everyone?

00:19:19.610 --> 00:19:22.380
They went to the souvenir shop.

00:19:22.380 --> 00:19:23.370
I see.

00:19:30.790 --> 00:19:32.130
Tina.

00:19:32.130 --> 00:19:33.740
Um...

00:19:33.740 --> 00:19:34.440
Hm?!

00:19:36.260 --> 00:19:37.970
That is...

00:19:37.970 --> 00:19:39.190
Thanks.

00:19:39.190 --> 00:19:40.170
Hm?!

00:19:41.270 --> 00:19:42.660
For what?

00:19:43.540 --> 00:19:46.010
T-That doesn't matter, does it?

00:19:47.680 --> 00:19:49.410
What do you mean, Kaoru?

00:19:51.410 --> 00:19:53.500
That's creepy.

00:19:58.800 --> 00:20:01.130
{Big Brother}Onii-chan, I won this!

00:20:01.130 --> 00:20:02.020
Heh!

00:20:02.020 --> 00:20:03.250
What is that?

00:20:05.660 --> 00:20:07.520
Ah, excuse me a second.

00:20:10.100 --> 00:20:12.310
Sorry to keep you, everyone!

00:20:28.320 --> 00:20:29.820
What's wrong, Mayu-chan?

00:20:29.820 --> 00:20:31.830
I-It's nothing.

00:20:32.350 --> 00:20:34.080
Sorry, sorry!

00:20:34.080 --> 00:20:36.190
Sorry about that.

00:20:36.190 --> 00:20:38.550
We're all here, so let's go home.

00:20:38.550 --> 00:20:39.820
Ah, yes.

00:20:42.330 --> 00:20:45.510
Just now, I'm certain I heard her.

00:20:51.770 --> 00:20:54.440
I'll come back to the U.S.

00:21:00.310 --> 00:21:02.810
She's returning to America.

00:22:35.720 --> 00:22:38.210
Space, which
spreads out to infinity!

00:22:38.210 --> 00:22:39.130
Huh?

00:22:39.130 --> 00:22:40.740
The enemy battleship fires upon them,

00:22:40.740 --> 00:22:42.600
younger sisters, younger sisters, younger sisters!

00:22:42.600 --> 00:22:46.130
Ah, how wonderful they are,
sisters unrelated by blood.

00:22:46.130 --> 00:22:49.430
For the older brother, for justice, we'll fight!

00:22:49.430 --> 00:22:51.720
Next time, Onegai Sisters, episode 11

00:22:49.430 --> 00:22:51.720
Please

00:22:51.720 --> 00:22:52.640
Hey!

00:22:53.580 --> 00:22:55.970
Next time, Ai Yori Aoshi Enishi,

00:22:55.970 --> 00:22:57.210
Moonlight.

00:22:57.210 --> 00:22:59.010
You are the galaxy's far side...

00:22:59.010 --> 00:23:00.060
Rejected!

00:23:01.100 --> 00:23:03.020
{B-Big Brother}O-Onii-chan!

00:23:03.020 --> 00:23:04.020
Gakou!
